# AR-9 / AD-16: nothing secret or unneeded reaches the build context.
# `**/` because a bare `.env*` only matches the context root, and
# `.auto-claude/` holds a `.env`.
**/.env*
!.env.example
.git
**/node_modules
_bmad-output
_bmad
.claude
config
.output
.nitro
.tanstack
coverage
.auto-claude
.wrangler
**/.DS_Store
